        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"from\": \"{{$vars.FROM_NAME}} <{{$vars.FROM_EMAIL}}>\",\n  \"to\": [\"{{ $json.properties.email.value }}\"],\n  \"subject\": \"Still thinking about your HVAC service? — Apex Comfort\",\n  \"html\": \"<p>Hi {{ $json.properties.firstname.value }},</p><p>We reached out a couple of times but haven't heard back. We completely understand — life gets busy.</p><p>If you're still thinking about getting your HVAC system serviced, we'd love to help. We're currently booking appointments this week and next.</p><p>Just hit reply or give us a call at {{$vars.COMPANY_PHONE}} — no pressure, no obligation.</p><p>Either way, hope you have a great week!</p><p>— The Apex Comfort Team</p><p><small>If you'd prefer not to hear from us, just reply 'STOP' and we'll remove you from our list.</small></p>\"\n}",
        "options": {}
